    "了解Hay Tar Gay的日常生活。IKEA Foundation和国际助残的合作令众多儿童受益匪浅，Hay Tar Gay就是其中一位。",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://v.youku.com/v_show/id_XMzEzMTEzNzU1Mg==.html?spm=a2hww.20027244.m_250036.5~5!2~5~5!2~5~5~A",
     "text": "\n<p>了解Hay Tar Gay的日常生活。IKEA Foundation和国际助残的合作令众多儿童受益匪浅，Hay Tar Gay就是其中一位。</p>\n"
    }
   ],
   "items": [],
   "productIds": [],
   "settings": null
